# ZX-GliderRider -- cmap for ZX-GliderRider.png (see docs/framebuf/bmfont.md)
# Only space, ! - . 0-9 : A-Z and a-z are drawn; the other cells are blank so
# are left unmapped.
U+0020..U+0021  0     # space !
U+002D..U+002E  13    # - .
U+0030..U+003A  16    # 0-9 :
U+0041..U+005A  33    # A-Z
U+0061..U+007A  65    # a-z
U+00A0          0     # NBSP shares space
